{"id":"old-iranian-1347059","title":"Brave of the era","imdbCode":"old-iranian-1347059","imdbUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt12546888/","source":"old-iranian-archive","sourceName":"Old Iranian Film Archive","sourcePageUrl":"https://oldfarsi.blogspot.com/search/label/%D8%AF%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%88%D8%B1%20%D8%AF%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%86","sourceUrls":["https://oldfarsi.blogspot.com/search/label/%D8%AF%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%88%D8%B1%20%D8%AF%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%86","https://oldfarsi.blogspot.com/search?q=%D8%AF%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%88%D8%B1%20%D8%AF%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%86"],"type":"movie","year":1968,"persianYear":1347,"releaseDate":"1968-01-01","originalTitle":"Delavar Douran","imdbVotes":0,"imdbRating":null,"groups":["Old Iranian Films"],"qualities":[],"links":[],"genres":["Adventure","Drama","Romance"],"persianGenres":["فیلم قدیمی ایرانی"],"countries":["Iran"],"persianCountries":["ایران"],"languages":["Persian"],"persianLanguages":["فارسی"],"overview":"A young man named Delavar, who works on a ship, returns to his hometown of Abadan after many years away from home. He meets his cousin Mansour at the dock. Delavar saves a girl named Maryam from being harassed and molested by a few young vagrants. It soon becomes clear that Maryam is the daughter of a wealthy man named Bozorgzadeh, whose house Delavar's mother has been working in for many years. Delavar later learns that Maryam was his playmate during his childhood and adolescence. Delavar gets a job at Bozorgzadeh's factory with Maryam's mediation, unaware that Maryam's father is trying to get his daughter married to his cousin Parviz. Parviz, who discovers Delavar and Maryam's romantic relationship, begins to plot and scheming against Delavar, and Delavar is unintentionally drawn into adventures that may ruin his life or even cause him to lose his life.","persianOverview":null,"tagline":null,"runtimeMinutes":107,"posterUrl":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYmJiMGFlMjgtYTlmMy00MmRhLTk0YmYtOWMxNTA3YjI0YWY5XkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.